<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US">Hi all<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoPlainText" style=3D"text-indent:10.5pt"><span lang=3D"EN-US"=
>&nbsp;This is the weekly test result for 20120505-1 building. QA tested 4 =
QEMU and 3 non-intel BSPs, as well as ADT. There are 3 BLOCK bugs reported.=
 The qemuarm/mips sato-sdk images build failed
 due to dependency of mesa-demos, report as bug 2428.&nbsp;Connman build fa=
iled with sato/sato-sdk images on qemuppc and mpc8315e , report as bug 2429=
.&nbsp;The mpc8315e can not boot with minimal image, report as bug 2430. Fo=
r ADT, QA checked the basic functions of adt-installer,
 meta-toolchain, poky build tree and eclipse tools, they all perform well.<=
o:p></o:p></span></p>
